'''The Crystal Passage''' was a [[hyperspace route]] located in the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. The [[planet]] [[Geonosis]] in the [[Arkanis sector]] was situated along the Crystal Passage,<ref name="BMF 19" /> where it crossed paths with the [[Triellus Trade Route]].<ref name="Rise" />

